.TH RNG_FLOAT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rng_float \- A random float in [0, 1)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqrng.h\(dq
.BI "float rng_float(uint64_t *s);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
A random float in [0, 1). Scale it yourself, or use rng_between() and rng_chance().
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
a value from 0 up to but not including 1.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/rng.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rng_between (3),
.BR rng_chance (3),
.BR rng_next (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
